      "scenes": [
        {
          "audio": "Give me a shout when there is a good price.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A static, high-angle shot focusing on the bottom half of a smartphone screen held against a clean, white, minimalist background. The phone has a black bezel and rounded corners. An input field is visible at the bottom where Chinese text is being entered. The lighting is bright and even, casting virtually no shadows, creating a high-key, tech-focused aesthetic. The color palette is dominated by white and shades of soft grey.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "timestamp_end": "0:02",
          "timestamp_start": "0:00"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Then you can see it go and check the market for itself.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "The camera pulls back to show the full smartphone interface in a centered, vertical orientation. The screen displays a messaging app interface with blue and grey chat bubbles. The camera then smoothly pans and zooms into the text body on the screen, revealing a detailed list of product information including pricing tiers and specific model numbers. The background remains a sterile, pure white void.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 2,
          "timestamp_end": "0:05",
          "timestamp_start": "0:02"
        },
        {
          "audio": "It then comes back to me to confirm the standard version, the price is lower than 3899, check it every morning.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "The camera transitions to a tight crop of the text interface, performing a slow vertical scroll. Highlights appear over specific parts of the text, specifically focusing on price points and scheduling settings. The font is clean and sans-serif. The motion is fluid, simulating a user scrolling through an automated report. Lighting remains consistent and cool-toned.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 3,
          "timestamp_end": "0:11",
          "timestamp_start": "0:05"
        },
        {
          "audio": "After the rule is set, it will go and check by itself every morning.",
          "label": "Usage Scenarios",
          "visual": "The view shifts to a settings panel with toggle switches and selection menus. A dark grey overlay appears over the white background as a specific menu item is selected. The camera is static, focusing on the UI interaction. The saturation is low, emphasizing the professional, utility-driven nature of the software interface.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 4,
          "timestamp_end": "0:13",
          "timestamp_start": "0:11"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Don't bother me if the price isn't reached.",
          "label": "Problem Solving",
          "visual": "The camera zooms in further on a specific paragraph of text that outlines the 'quiet mode' or 'no disturbance' logic of the application. The text is black against a slightly off-white digital paper background. The framing is tight, removing all peripheral UI elements to focus purely on the text-based logic of the app's notification system.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 5,
          "timestamp_end": "0:15",
          "timestamp_start": "0:13"
        },
        {
          "audio": "After setting it up, it will run first, look at the results.",
          "label": "Call to Action",
          "visual": "The final scene shows the bottom of the chat interface again. A blue bubble appears on the right side of the screen, followed by a longer response in a grey bubble on the left. The camera remains static as the text populates, simulating a real-time conversation. The screen then begins a final slow scroll downward as the video ends.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 6,
          "timestamp_end": "0:17",
          "timestamp_start": "0:15"
        }
      ]
